    <fr:title text="German Potato Salad">German Potato Salad</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Recipe</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
      <fr:frontmatter>
        <fr:authors>
          <fr:author>
            <fr:link href="/stevenschaefer/" title="Steven Schaefer" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/stevenschaefer/" display-uri="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
          </fr:author>
        </fr:authors>
        <fr:date>
          <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
          <fr:month>2</fr:month>
          <fr:day>19</fr:day>
        </fr:date>
        <fr:title text="Ingredients">Ingredients</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:ul><html:li>5 pounds potatoes</html:li>
<html:li>1 pound bacon</html:li>
<html:li>1 cup sour cream</html:li>
<html:li>2 cups mayo</html:li>
<html:li>1 cup cold water</html:li>
<html:li>1 tbsp sugar</html:li>
<html:li>1 onion</html:li></html:ul>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
    <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
      <fr:frontmatter>
        <fr:authors>
          <fr:author>
            <fr:link href="/stevenschaefer/" title="Steven Schaefer" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/stevenschaefer/" display-uri="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
          </fr:author>
        </fr:authors>
        <fr:date>
          <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
          <fr:month>2</fr:month>
          <fr:day>19</fr:day>
        </fr:date>
        <fr:title text="Instructions">Instructions</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:ol><html:li>Peel and cube potatoes.</html:li>
<html:li>Boil potatoes until fork tender, but still slightly firm.</html:li>
<html:li>Cook bacon, then crumble. Reserve bacon grease.</html:li>
<html:li>Dice onion and cook in bacon grease until brown.</html:li>
<html:li>Mix bacon, onion, potatoes, mayo, sour cream, cold water, 1 tbsp salt, 1 tbsp pepper, and sugar in an oven-safe bowl.</html:li>
<html:li>Bake for 60 minutes at 350 Fahrenheit. Broil for 5-7 minutes, or until golden brown.</html:li></html:ol>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
    <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
      <fr:frontmatter>
        <fr:authors>
          <fr:author>
            <fr:link href="/stevenschaefer/" title="Steven Schaefer" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/stevenschaefer/" display-uri="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
          </fr:author>
        </fr:authors>
        <fr:date>
          <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
          <fr:month>2</fr:month>
          <fr:day>19</fr:day>
        </fr:date>
        <fr:title text="The Annoying Bit That I Wish Recipe Writers Put on the Bottom">The Annoying Bit That I Wish Recipe Writers Put on the Bottom</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>This is another cherished recipe from my mother.</html:p>
        <html:p>As a child, I was extraordinarily averse to mayo, sour cream, cottage cheese, etc. I didn't understand how delicious this recipe was until I was about 20 or so. I can't believe I had missed out for so long.</html:p>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
  </fr:mainmatter>
